(26, 28, 10, 'Airbrush', 'airbrush26', 'img_20251227_010819.jpg', '', 2, 9999.00, 'Course Description – Shanrisha Ladies Beauty Academy\r\nShanrisha Ladies Beauty Academy me hum aapko professional beauty skills sikhaate hain jo aapke career ko next level tak le jaaye.\r\nHumara practical + theory based curriculum designed hai beginners se leke advanced learners tak ke liye, jisme latest trends aur professional techniques cover ki jaati hain.\r\nKya Sikhenge Students:\r\nBasic Beautician Skills: Skin care, facials, manicure & pedicure, waxing, threading, and makeup fundamentals.\r\nAdvanced Makeup: Day, party, bridal makeup, contouring, highlighting, eye & lip makeup techniques.\r\nAirbrush Makeup: Specialized module covering tools, techniques, bridal & party airbrush looks, special effects, and practical sessions with live models.\r\nHair & Hair Styling: Hair spa, treatments, blow drying, straightening, curling, and bridal hairstyles.\r\nSkin & Facial Treatments: HydraFacial, O3/Oxy facial, acne & pigmentation management, anti-aging care.\r\nSalon Management & Professional Skills: Hygiene, customer handling, portfolio building, and marketing tips.\r\nWhy Choose Us:\r\n✔ Experienced trainers with industry knowledge\r\n✔ Practical hands-on training on real models\r\n✔ Certificate provided after course completion\r\n✔ Career guidance for salon jobs or starting your own beauty business\r\n✔ Hygienic & professional learning environment\r\nCourse Duration: 3–6 Months (Flexible depending on modules)\r\nLocation: Dildarnagar\r\nEnrollment: Limited seats – Book Now!\r\n', 'Shanrisha Ladies Beauty Academy – Professional Beauty Course Curriculum\r\nCourse Duration: 3–6 Months (Depends on modules chosen)\r\nMode: Practical + Theory\r\nCertificate: Yes (After completion)\r\n1️⃣ Basic Beautician Course\r\nIntroduction to beauty industry\r\nSkin types & skin care routine\r\nFace cleansing & basic facial techniques\r\nManicure & Pedicure basics\r\nWaxing & threading basics\r\nMakeup fundamentals\r\n2️⃣ Advanced Makeup Course\r\nDay makeup\r\nParty makeup\r\nBridal makeup (Traditional & Modern)\r\nContouring & highlighting techniques\r\nEye makeup styles (smokey, cut crease, winged eyeliner)\r\nLip makeup techniques\r\n3️⃣ Airbrush Makeup Module\r\nIntroduction: What is Airbrush Makeup, tools, and equipment\r\nSkin & Product Knowledge: Primer, foundation, highlighter, colour matching\r\nAirbrush Techniques:\r\nBasic strokes & blending\r\nFoundation application\r\nContouring & highlighting\r\nBlush, eyeshadow, and lip techniques\r\nBridal & Party Airbrush Makeup\r\nSpecial Effects (Optional/Advanced): Body art, shimmer, glitter\r\nMaintenance & Cleaning: Airbrush machine care & troubleshooting\r\nPractical Sessions: Live model practice, real-time looks, portfolio preparation\r\n4️⃣ Hair & Hair Styling\r\nHair spa & treatments\r\nBlow drying, straightening & curling\r\nBridal & party hairstyles\r\nHair accessory usage\r\n5️⃣ Skin & Facial Treatments\r\nBasic facials\r\nHydraFacial / O3 / Oxy Facial overview\r\nAcne treatment & pigmentation management\r\nAnti-aging facial techniques\r\n6️⃣ Salon Management & Professional Skills\r\nHygiene & safety protocols\r\nCustomer handling & consultation\r\nTime management & service efficiency\r\nPortfolio building & marketing tips\r\n7️⃣ Certification & Career Opportunities\r\nCertificate provided after completion\r\nGuidance for working in salons or starting own beauty business\r\nInternship / demo sessions included\r\n', '0', '1', 1, '2025-12-27 01:23:42', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, NULL),
