(181, 'N', 'packages/detail', 55, 'regular-manicure', 'Regular Manicure', 'This Manicure Will Pamper Your Hands, Leaving Them De-Stressed And Visibly Groomed.', 'Them, De-Stressed, Visibly, Groomed, Leaving, Hands, Manicure, Will, Pamper, Your, This', '1'),
(182, 'N', 'packages/detail', 56, 'marine-hand-glow', 'Marine Hand Glow', 'Let the Marine World Reveal Its Secrets To You Ina Ritual That Exfoliate. Nourishes And Moisturises Your Hands', 'Nourishes, Moisturises, Your, Hands, Exfoliate, That, World, Reveal, Secrets, Ritual, Marine', '1'),
(183, 'N', 'packages/detail', 57, 'candy-crush-manicure', 'Candy Crush Manicure', 'Indulge In The Decadence Of Candy Without The Calories! a mixture Of Natural Butters, Pure Essentials Oils, And Super Cute Cupcake Like Detoxifying Effervescent Bath Bombs, The Manicure Promises to go away Your Hands', 'Bath, Bombs, Effervescent, Detoxifying, Like, Manicure, Promises, Smooth, Rejuvenated, Soft, Hands, Your, Cupcake, Cute, Calories, mixture, Without, Candy, Decadence, Natural', '1'),
(184, 'N', 'packages/detail', 58, 'honey-wax-package', 'Honey Wax Package', 'Timing: 60 MIN Honey Wax Full Arms & Underarms 2) Honey Wax Full Legs/Half Legs 3) Contact-Less Eyebrow Threading 4) Contact-Less Upperlip Threading', 'Threading, Contact-Less, Legs, Honey, Full, Eyebrow, Upperlip, Half, Underarms, Timing, Arms', '1'),
(185, 'N', 'packages/detail', 59, 'honey-bikini-wax-package', 'Honey Bikini Wax Package', 'Timing :  60 MIN   Sugar/Spice Chocolate Waxing - Full Arms, Underarms & Full Legs 2) Sugar/Spice Chocolate-Bikini Waxing 3) Contact-Less Threading - Eyebrows, Upperlip & Forehead', 'Full, Spice, Waxing, Sugar, Threading, Eyebrows, Upperlip, Forehead, Contact-Less, Underarms, Chocolate, Arms, Timing, Legs, Chocolate-Bikini', '1'),
(186, 'N', 'packages/detail', 60, 'regular-bridal-makeup', 'Regular Bridal Makeup', 'This price for bridal makeup is the least expensive of the one bridal packages offered by Beaunic Salon . It involves sprucely selecting high quality chemical free cosmetics for makeup and styling. The high quality', 'sitting, bridal, makeup, full, special, quality, hair, massage, facial, incorporations, package, session, polishing, eyebrows, pedicure, viii, manicure, chin, forehead, upper', '1'),
(187, 'N', 'packages/detail', 61, 'special-bridal-package-by-the-golden-palms-and-spa', 'Special Bridal Package By The Golden Palms- And Spa:', 'This is mainly a pre-bridal package that makes you ready for your engagement, Mehendi and Sangeet. It works on making your skin problem free and radiant. A few special incorporations of this pre-bridal engagement ready', 'engagement, package, ready, pre-bridal, full, glow, crystal, rose, papaya, massage, salt, toning, manicure, pedicure, threading, hair, session, facial, scrub, incorporations', '1'),
(188, 'N', 'packages/detail', 62, 'reception-bridal-package', 'Reception Bridal Package', 'Beaunic Salon that offers skin healthy cosmetics. The Reception bridal package by Beaunic Salon offers a sophisticated look to Indian Brides. A few special incorporations of the Reception Bridal Package by Beaunic Salon', 'Salon, Beaunic, Indian, offers, Reception, south, styling, Hair, shape, Lehanga, style, hair, flowers, face, hands, Makeup, ornaments, traditional, beads, accessories', '1'),
(189, 'N', 'packages/detail', 63, 'premium-bridal-makeup', 'Premium Bridal Makeup', 'This bridal package focuses on making Indian brides photo ready for their wedding day. It may include gold facial, waxing, body exfoliation, manicure, pedicure and threading.', 'facial, gold, include, waxing, exfoliation, threading, pedicure, manicure, wedding, ready, focuses, package, bridal, making, Indian, photo, brides, This', '1'),
(190, 'N', 'packages/detail', 64, 'altra-glow-bridal-package', 'Altra Glow Bridal Package', 'This is a bridal package exclusive to dull skin. This 2 weeks bridal care treatment offers the goodness of Meso Glow and Aqua radiance to transform your skin from lifeless to lively.   The above-listed 10 bridal makeup', 'bridal, transform, This, skin, package, Would, experience, special, completely, dramatic, treatments, looks, packages, feedback, comment, section, share, wedding, dream, Which', '1'),
(191, 'Y', 'pages/index/shop', 0, 'shop', 'shop', 'shop', 'shop', '1'),
(192, 'N', 'packages/detail', 65, 'threading', 'Threading', 'Time: 30 Min Note:- Eyebrow, Forehead, Upper lip, Chin,   Eyebrow threading is an ancient hair-removal technique, practiced for centuries among the most beautiful women of Asia and the Middle East. It is the best', 'skin, method, waxing, threading, Eyebrow, damage, Unlike, susceptible, invasive, face, remove, leave, layer, hair, well-defined, edges, frame, clean, brow, removal', '1'),
(193, 'N', 'centers/details', 16, '91252022', 'Madhu Makeup Parlour Salon', 'this center is unique', 'unique, center', '1'),
(194, 'N', 'courses/detail', 17, 'hair-cut17', 'Hair cut', 'ttempting to explain to a woman, just how critical her hair is in determining her over-arching appearance, would be a fool\'s errand. After-all our hair, more often than not, is one of our most prized possessions and one', 'hair, trending, women, huge, season, hairstyles, latest, worries, Read, discover, employ, sassy, hairdos, short, medium, length, cover, comprehensive, ease, classy', '1'),
(195, 'N', 'courses/detail', 18, 'skin-care18', 'Skin Care', 'We spoke with dermatologists and top beauty experts to put together a list of some of the best skincare tips. From choosing the right cleanser for your skin type to the importance of cleaning your makeup brushes, these', 'skin, plus, product, top-tested, tricks, brushes, easy, picks, Good, glowing, ASAP, guide, Beauty, Housekeeping, Institute, makeup, cleaning, list, skincare, together', '1'),
(196, 'N', 'courses/detail', 19, 'makeup19', 'Makeup', 'Beauticians who want to learn professional makeup artistry or people who wish to enhance their makeup skills for personal learning must undergo this course', 'makeup, personal, skills, learning, enhance, undergo, course, wish, learn, professional, artistry, people, Beauticians', '1'),
(197, 'N', 'courses/detail', 20, 'beauticion20', 'beauticion', 'A beautician can be known by many titles depending on the specialization: aesthetician, cosmetologist, hair stylist, and hair dresser. Ultimately, a beautician\'s responsibility is to improve the physical appearance of', 'hair, responsibility, beautician\'s, improve, physical, themselves, clients, appearance, Ultimately, dresser, depending, titles, specialization, aesthetician, stylist, cosmetologist, beautician', '1'),
