rif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);\">Lotus Gold Facial @1199/-</span></span></span></small></span></li>\r\n <li style=\"margin: 5px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 600; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: 28px; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; outline: none; background: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); list-style: none; position: relative; clear: both;\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082;\"><small><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode,lucida grande,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">O3+ Power Brightening Facial @1799/-</span></span></span></small></span></li>\r\n <li style=\"margin: 5px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 600; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: 28px; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; outline: none; background: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); list-style: none; position: relative; clear: both;\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082;\"><small><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode,lucida grande,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);\">Raga Fairness Facial @1799/-</span></span></span></small></span></li>\r\n <li style=\"margin: 5px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: 600; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: 28px; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; outline: none; background: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); list-style: none; position: relative; clear: both;\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082;\"><small><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode,lucida grande,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0