(24, 16, '16', 'HAIR COLOUR', 'hair-colour', NULL, 1, 6999.00, 0.00, '<h1 style=\"background: rgb(238, 238, 238); border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); padding: 5px 10px; text-align: center;\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"><samp><tt><span style=\"background-color: rgb(242, 242, 242); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Hair coloring, or hair dyeing, is the practice of changing the hair color. Discover your ideal hair color when you explore our range of shades, products, and formulas. Bold to subtle, temporary to permanent & dark to light; buy hair dye that delivers exactly what you’re looking for in Beaunic Salon.</span></tt></samp></span></span></strong></em></h1>\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"background: rgb(238, 238, 238); border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); padding: 5px 10px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color:#FAEBD7;\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\"><em><strong><span style=\"background-color:#8B4513;\">Global Colour</span></strong></em></span></span></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"background: rgb(238, 238, 238); border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); padding: 5px 10px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color:#FAEBD7;\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\"><em><strong><span style=\"background-color:#8B4513;\">Highlights</span></strong></em></span></span></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<h1 style=\"background: rgb(238, 238, 238); border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); padding: 5px 10px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color:#FAEBD7;\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\"><em><strong><span style=\"background-color:#8B4513;\">Colour Streaks</span></strong></em></span></span></span></h1>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"color:#FFF0F5;\"><strong><em><span style=\"background-color:#000000;\">All Package Use Only One Times.....</span></em></strong></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"color:#006400;\"><span style=\"font-family:courier new,courier,monospace;\"><small><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">Colour Streaks / (Every Streaks) <strong>@ 249/-</strong></span></small></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"color:#006400;\"><span style=\"font-family:courier new,courier,monospace;\"><small><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);\">Hair Color Application (Provided by customer) <strong>@ 249/-</strong></span></small></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"color:#006400;\"><span style=\"font-family:courier new,courier,monospace;\"><small><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">Henna Application (Provided by customer) @ 199/-</span></small></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"color:#006400;\"><span style=\"font-family:courier new,courier,monospace;\"><small><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);\">L Oreal Inoa Global color Upto Shoulder @1999/-</span></small></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"color:#006400;\"><span style=\"font-family:courier new,courier,monospace;\"><small><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">L Oreal Inoa Global Color Upto Waist @ 2999/-</span></small></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"color:#006400;\"><span style=\"font-family:courier new,courier,monospace;\"><small><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);\">L Oreal Touch up @ 599/-</span></small></span></span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n', '0', '1', '2021-01-16 04:39:12', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 'HAIR COLOR'),
(25, 16, '16', 'HAIR TREATMENTS', 'hair-treatments', NULL, 2, 1299.00, 0.00, '<p><strong>Hair Care : </strong>From hair clinging to your pillow covers to clogged up drains, hair fall is a messy problem that affects us all. While it is absolutely normal to lose 80-100 strands a day, the crisis begins when they fall a lot more or when they refuse to grow back. Your ‘crowning glory’ can give you sleepless nights as you slowly step towards the dreaded B-word – *whispers* baldness.Why does this happen? Well, there are way too many triggers from nutrition to hereditary issues. But once you know the root cause of your hairfall, it gets simpler to tackle the problem!</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: latoregular, serif; font-size: 20px; text-transform: uppercase;\">SOME COMMON TRIGGERS FOR HAIRFALL:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: latoregular, serif; font-size: 17px; text-transform: uppercase;\">NUTRITIONAL DEFICIENCIES,  GENETIC,  HORMONAL,  STRESS,  MEDICATIONS,  IMMUNITY,  RADIATION,  TIGHT HAIRDOS</span></p>\r\n', '0', '1', '2021-08-21 06:49:35', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 'HAIR TREATMENTS'),
(40, 13, '13', 'Hair Problems', 'hair-problems', NULL, 7, 1999.00, 0.00, '<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Beaunic Hair Care Services – For the Latest Hair Styles and Treatments</span></strong><br />\r\nWelcome to our beauty salon! We understand that your hair is a reflection of your personality and style, which is why we take hair care seriously. Our team of experienced stylists is dedicated to providing you with the latest trends and techniques to ensure that your hair looks and feels its best.</p>\r\n\r\n<div><strong>Tips for hair care</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div>Here are a few tips to help you care for your hair at home:</div>\r\n\r\n<div>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Brush your hair before you shower. This helps to remove tangles and knots, making it easier to wash and style.</div>\r\n\r\n<div>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Use a sulfate-free shampoo and conditioner. Sulfates can strip your hair of its natural oils, leaving it dry and damaged.</div>\r\n\r\n<div>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Avoid using heat styling tools too often. If you must use them, make sure to use a heat protectant to minimize damage.</div>\r\n\r\n<div>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Trim your hair regularly. Regular trims can help prevent split ends and keep your hair looking healthy.</div>\r\n\r\n<div>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Protect your hair from the sun and other environmental factors. Use a scarf or hat to cover your hair when you are outside, especially during the summer months.</div>\r\n\r\n<div> </div>\r\n\r\n<div><strong>How can we help you?</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div>If you are looking for a new look or just want to maintain your current style, we offer a wide range of services, including haircuts, coloring, styling, and more. Here is the detailed list of the hair care offerings that we provide you at our salon or at your place.</div>\r\n\r\n<div>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Hair Ombre</div>\r\n\r\n<div>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Hair Rebonding</div>\r\n\r\n<div>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Hair Cut for Women</div>\r\n\r\n<div>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Hair Styling</div>\r\n\r\n<div>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Perm and Straightening</div>\r\n\r\n<div>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Hair Colouring and highlighting</div>\r\n\r\n<div>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Hair Spa</div>\r\n\r\n<div>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Hair Conditioning</div>\r\n\r\n<div>•<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>Hair Treatments – Scalp, Hair Detox, Hot Oil treatments, etc.</div>\r\n\r\n<div> </div>\r\n\r\n<div>We use only the best products and tools to ensure that your hair looks and feels its best.</div>\r\n\r\n<div> </div>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<p><strong>Let’s Connect</strong><br />\r\nThank you for choosing us for your hair care needs in advance. We look forward to helping you achieve your desired look with the help of our expert hair stylists.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n', '0', '1', '2023-03-06 11:09:02', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, ''),
(41, 13, '13', 'Perty Makeup', 'perty-makeup', NULL, 7, 1200.00, 0.00, '<div><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Party Makeup : One of the best things about makeup is that you can change it up to suit your whims and fancies. </span></div>\r\n\r\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Makeup is fun. And the right makeup at the right time helps us feel even better in our own skin.</span></div>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10px;\"><span style=\"font-style: italic; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 250); color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Beaunic Salon has over the years all kinds of makeup artists who are ready to suit your every function and make you feel comfortable.</span></span> <span class=\"Y2IQFc\" lang=\"en\">Which makes your look more attractive.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<div> </div>\r\n', '0', '1', '2021-08-21 09:13:33', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, ''),
(42, 13, '13', 'Manicure (Nail Care)', 'manicure-nail-care', NULL, 5, 1599.00, 0.00, '<p><strong>Manicure: </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">A manicure is a cosmetic beauty treatment for the fingernails and hands performed in a nail salon. A manicure consists of filing and shaping the free edge of nails, pushing and clipping (with a cuticle pusher and cuticle nippers) any nonliving tissue (but limited to the cuticle and hangnails), treatments with various liquids, massage of the hand, and the application of fingernail polish. </span></div>\r\n\r\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"> Most nail polish can stay on nails for 2–3 days before another manicure, if there is no deliberate damage to it.</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div> </div>\r\n\r\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Other nail treatments may include the application of artificial gel nails, tips, or acrylics, which may be referred to as French manicures.</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div> </div>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-style: italic; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 250); color: rgb(32, 33, 36); font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong>Buanic Salon</strong> offers all types of nail designs to its customers. and gives them comfortable service</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<div> </div>\r\n', '0', '1', '2021-08-21 09:34:41', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, ''),
(43, 13, '13', 'Pedicure Service', 'pedicure-service', NULL, 2, 900.00, 0.00, '<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Beaunic Pedicure Services: Giving A Makeover To Your Feet</span></strong><br />\r\nBeaunic salon is the epitome of trust and class. We offer irresistible beauty services to our valuable clients and make them cheerful. Our trained professionals make every possible effort to please customers through pedicure services.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The pedicure services at Beaunic exemplify the most soothing and optimal ways. We incorporate soaking, rubbing, moisturizing, and applying nail polish of different appealing colors. After availing of our pedicure services, you will feel your feet become more adorable and sparkling clean. </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Our Pedicure services</strong><br />\r\nYour feet also deserve your attention, love, and personal care. Here, you can rely on our Beaunic salon to get nourished and attractive feet like never before. We offer the best aesthetic pedicure service at home for male and female clients alike. Our experts are capable of transforming your feet from dull to extremely lustrous. The topmost pedicure services at our beauty salon include:   <br />\r\n  <br />\r\n<strong>Remove Nail Polish</strong><br />\r\nIn the process of a pedicure, removing nail paint is the first step.<br />\r\n <br />\r\n<strong>Soak Feet</strong><br />\r\nAfter removing nail polish, we soak your feet in lukewarm water. We add natural ingredients, soothing fragrance, and essential oil to the water.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Take Care of Cuticles</strong><br />\r\nIt involves the massage of nail beds with oil to remove cuticles.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Exfoliate</strong><br />\r\nIt removes the dead skin of your feet and makes them gorgeous.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Treat Calluses</strong><br />\r\nIt improves the texture of feet bottoms and treats calluses.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Trim and File Nails</strong><br />\r\nDone with a filer to trim and give a nice shape to your nails it makes your feet look more appealing.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Massage Feet and Moisturize</strong><br />\r\nThis process includes massage and moisturization to keep feet hydrated</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Apply Polish </strong><br />\r\nAs the last step of the pedicure, we let the nails of your feet dry and apply your favorite nail polish.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Book Your Appointment Today</strong><br />\r\nIf you require exquisite pedicure services, think about our Beaunic salon in Delhi. We will feel honored to book your appointment and offer our optimal services at your home or in our salon. </p>\r\n', '0', '1', '2023-03-06 10:55:36', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, ''),
(44, 13, '13', 'Bridal Mehandi Service', 'bridal-mehandi-service', NULL, 9, 999.00, 0.00, '<p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><strong>Bridal Mehandi Service:</strong> Indian weddings include an awe-inspiring lineup of pre-wedding rituals. And nothing electrifies the bride and her bridesmaids more than the fun-filled Mehendi function! When it comes to getting your hands stained with henna, brides-to-be will accept nothing short of the most beautiful and exquisite bridal Mehndi design.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">While some brides prefer intricate and traditional indian bridal mehndi designs, others go exploring a bit fancy in this regard. And we can’t stop drooling over how pretty the brides look with their arms decked up with all sorts of patterns, from the fashionable mandala designs to elegant bracelet style mehndi, the much desired arabic mehndi design or more quirky styles like glitter, colour or white mehndi.</span></p>\r\n', '0', '1', '2023-02-23 20:31:58', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, ''),
