ound:=\"\" helvetica=\"\" none=\"\" open=\"\" outline:=\"\" style=\"margin: 20px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 20px; font-family: \" text-align:=\"\" vertical-align:=\"\">Specially Formulated to contain Juvexin Keratin, which rebuilds, restores & rejuvenate the hair giving a softer, silker feel.</h2>\r\n\r\n<div background:=\"\" color:=\"\" helvetica=\"\" none=\"\" open=\"\" outline:=\"\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 23px 0px 0px; border-width: 0px 0px 1px; border-top-style: initial; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: solid; border-left-style: initial; border-top-color: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: rgb(207, 207, 207); border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: \" text-align:=\"\" vertical-align:=\"\"> </div>\r\n\r\n<h2 background:=\"\" none=\"\" open=\"\" outline:=\"\" style=\"margin: 40px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 34px; line-height: 44px; font-family: \" text-align:=\"\" text-transform:=\"\" vertical-align:=\"\"><strong>RIRTUALS</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<h2 background:=\"\" helvetica=\"\" none=\"\" open=\"\" outline:=\"\" style=\"margin: 20px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 20px; font-family: \" text-align:=\"\" vertical-align:=\"\">Kerastase Rirtuals</h2>\r\n', '0', '1', '2021-08-18 14:07:20', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 'HAIR SPA'),
(27, 17, '17', 'BLEACH', 'bleach', NULL, 8, 6499.00, 0.00, '<p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px;\">Bleaching services at Black Beauty Salon are gentle and skin friendly and are really efficient. We provide an easy and painless way to overcome the lifelessness of skin brought by pollution and UV rays. Our bleaching services will bring in the added glow and makes you feel fresh and fairer. The bleaching services in our salon are done by our practiced skincare artists, hence does not cause harm to your skin and leaves only unblemished, clean and clear skin.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px;\"><span style=\"background-color:#000000;\">All Packages using</span><em><span style=\"background-color:#000000;\"> </span></em></span></strong></span><span style=\"color:#FFA07A;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.2px;\"><em><span style=\"background-color:#000000;\">One Time</span></em></span></strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<pre>\r\n<span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\"><small><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">Basic Fruit Bleach @199/-</span></small>\r\n<small><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);\">Cheryls Bleach @499/-</span></small>\r\n<small><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">Face & Neck Bleach @399/-</span></small>\r\n<small><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);\">Face Bleach @199/-</span></small>\r\n<small><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">Face Neck Blouse Line Bleach @349/-</span></small>\r\n<small><sp