(29, 18, '18', 'MANICURE SERVICE', 'manicure-service', NULL, 7, 2999.00, 0.00, '<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Beaunic Manicure Services– Pampering Your Nails like a Newborn</span></strong><br />\r\nPamper yourself by indulging in the exquisite services of our Beaunic salon. From manicures to bridal makeup, our beauty salon offers magnificent beauty services for all your beauty needs. You can get any beauty services from trained professionals at our manicure salon.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nManicure is among the most traditional practices to take care of fingernails. At Beaunic, we will leave your nails polished and sparkling with vivid colors. Our satisfying services will make you feel relaxed, stress-free, and fresh.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Our manicure services</strong><br />\r\nYour hands deserve no less treatment than your face. This is where a manicure is the best treatment you can gift your hands to enhance their appearance. With personal care from our experts, we ensure optimal manicure services for our clients. Our bouquet of manicure services includes:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Classic manicure</strong><br />\r\nAn all-time favourite of every girl, it includes taking proper care of your hands and nails. For this, we carry out a thorough cleaning and moisturizing of your hands and nails, followed by the application of regular nail polish. We only use branded products on your hands to make them fascinating.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Crystal spa manicure</strong><br />\r\nThis luxurious treatment intends to protect the hands and make them more beautiful with powerful penetrating blends and botanical extracts.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>VLCC manicure</strong><br />\r\nIt contains the goodness of natural ingredients that makes hands lighten and brighten.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Deluxe manicure</strong><br />\r\nThis specific manicure treatment includes hand-soaking and moisturizing procedures. It makes hands soft and wrinkle-free by the exfoliation procedure and provides cuticle work by applying a renewed mask.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Lotus manicure</strong><br />\r\nTreatment from the products of this famous brand at our manicure parlor rejuvenates your hands appreciably. It involves nail soaking, moisturizing, nail paint application, buffering, and more.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Marine hand glow</strong><br />\r\nA widely recommended manicure service offered at our manicure salon, it comprises exfoliation, nourishing, and miniaturization treatments.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Mani cut file polish</strong><br />\r\nThrough this manicure service, we offer the clients their preferred nail shape and desired color nail polish application.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Let’s Connect</strong><br />\r\nContact us today for the best manicure services at home or in our beauty salon. We will be happy to pamper you with personal care of your nails, just like a newborn.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n', '0', '1', '2023-03-06 11:18:12', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, '');
