(30, 19, '19', 'BODY MASSAGE SERVICE', 'body-massage-service', NULL, 8, 499.00, 0.00, '<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Stay Calm By Indulging in Massage Therapies from Beaunic</span></strong><br />\r\nRelax your mind and body by opting out alluring massage services of our Beaunic salon. Whether you choose hand or full body massage, our salon is capable enough to offer you a completely relaxed and rejuvenated massage service.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>At our salon, you can explore a vast collection of massage services where we provide proper exfoliation and hydration to the body. You can feel incredibly smooth and soft after undergoing massage procedures. Occasionally, we combine the massage with a body polish to magnify the result.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Our massage services</strong><br />\r\nIf you are feeling tired, try our massage range carried out by trained professionals to stay energetic and rejuvenated all day long. Our massage services include the following types:</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Back massage</strong><br />\r\nForget stressful days by adopting our massage service. We use natural and chemical-free products for massaging. Therefore, you can surely love it and get relief from any level of stress.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Cream massage</strong><br />\r\nStay away from dry skin, especially in winter with our unique massage services. It offers deep moisturization and hydration.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Foot massage</strong><br />\r\nStimulate the blood circulation in your feet with the help of our innovative massage service. To keep tissues, and muscles healthy, it is an ideal option.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Full Body Massage</strong><br />\r\nDone by using the best quality products, it will help in enhancing the blood circulation of the scalp, promote relaxation, boost hair growth, and release stress. You can choose it with or without a head massage. </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Hand Foot Massage</strong><br />\r\nEnhance the beauty of your hands and feet by improving blood circulation and extreme nourishment.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Hand Massage</strong><br />\r\nIt includes kneading, circular motion, and rubbing techniques to relieve muscle pain.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Head Massage</strong><br />\r\nIt is a way to relieve stress and promote blood circulation. You can choose anyone from almond, coconut, and olive oil to get a massage.<br />\r\n   <br />\r\n<strong>Head Shoulder Massage</strong><br />\r\nFocus on the head and shoulder area, it can strengthen the follicles and relieve the stress of the upper body.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Neck Shoulder Massage</strong><br />\r\nIt reduces headaches, relieves tension, and improves relaxation.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Contact us today</strong><br />\r\nTo get our relaxing and soothing massage services, feel free to connect with us and book your appointment at a suitable time either at home or in our salon. We will be delighted to help you with our ultimate massage services.   </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><small><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">Back Massage @349/- Service Time- 25 min.</span></span></small></p>\r\n\r\n<p><small><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);\">Cream Massage </span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">@999/- Service Time- 25 min.</span></span></small></p>\r\n\r\n<p><small><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">Foot Massage @299/- Service Time- 15 min.</span></span></small></p>\r\n\r\n<p><small><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);\">Full Body excluding Head Massage </span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">@89</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">9/- Service Time- 60 min.</span></span></small></p>\r\n\r\n<p><small><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">Full Body including Head Massage @1149/- Service Time- 60 min.</span></span></small></p>\r\n\r\n<p><small><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);\">Hand Foot Massage </span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">@ 44</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">9/- Service Time- 30 min.</span></span></small></p>\r\n\r\n<p><small><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">Hand Massage @ 299/- Service Time- 15 min.</span></span></small></p>\r\n\r\n<p><small><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);\">Head Massage Almond Oil </span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">@ 34</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">9/- Service Time- 20 min.</span></span></small></p>\r\n\r\n<p><small><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">Head Massage Coconut Oil @ 299/- Service Time- 20 min.</span></span></small></p>\r\n\r\n<p><small><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);\">Head Massage Olive Oil </span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">@ 39</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">9/- Service Time- 25 min.</span></span></small></p>\r\n\r\n<p><small><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">Head Shoulder Massage @ 449/- Service Time- 35 min.</span></span></small></p>\r\n\r\n<p><small><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);\">Neck Shoulder Massage </span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">@ 399/- Service Time- 30 min.</span></span></small></p>\r\n', '0', '1', '2023-03-06 11:21:40', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, ''),
