/span></span></li>\r\n <li value=\"5\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\">Half Legs Wax</span></span></li>\r\n <li value=\"5\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\">Normal Manicure</span></span></li>\r\n <li value=\"5\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\">Normal Pedicure</span></span></li>\r\n <li value=\"5\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\">Eyebrows</span></span></li>\r\n <li value=\"5\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\">Upper lips</span></span></li>\r\n <li value=\"5\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman,times,serif;\">Forehead     </span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '0', '1', '2021-08-18 12:44:36', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, ''),
