(58, 22, '22', 'Honey Wax Package', 'honey-wax-package', NULL, 2, 559.00, 0.00, '<p><strong>Timing: 60 MIN</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Nexa, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif, \"Apple Color Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Symbol\", \"Noto Color Emoji\"; font-size: 11px;\">Honey Wax Full Arms & Underarms 2) </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Nexa, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif, \"Apple Color Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Symbol\", \"Noto Color Emoji\"; font-size: 11px;\">Honey Wax Full Legs/Half Legs 3) </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Nexa, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif, \"Apple Color Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Symbol\", \"Noto Color Emoji\"; font-size: 11px;\">Contact-Less Eyebrow Threading 4) </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Nexa, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif, \"Apple Color Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Symbol\", \"Noto Color Emoji\"; font-size: 11px;\">Contact-Less Upperlip Threading</span></p>\r\n', '0', '1', '2021-10-14 09:38:22', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, ''),
(59, 22, '22', 'Honey Bikini Wax Package', 'honey-bikini-wax-package', NULL, 9, 1099.00, 0.00, '<p><strong>Timing :  60 MIN</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Nexa, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif, \"Apple Color Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Symbol\", \"Noto Color Emoji\"; font-size: 11px;\">Sugar/Spice Chocolate Waxing - Full Arms, Underarms & Full Legs 2) </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Nexa, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif, \"Apple Color Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Symbol\", \"Noto Color Emoji\"; font-size: 11px;\">Sugar/Spice Chocolate-Bikini Waxing 3) </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Nexa, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif, \"Apple Color Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Symbol\", \"Noto Color Emoji\"; font-size: 11px;\">Contact-Less Threading - Eyebrows, Upperlip & Forehead</span></p>\r\n', '0', '1', '2021-10-14 09:47:55', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, ''),
(60, 1, '1', 'Regular Bridal Makeup', 'regular-bridal-makeup', NULL, 8, 1299.00, 0.00, '<p><span style=\"color: rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">This price for bridal makeup is the least expensive of the one bridal packages offered by <strong><u>Beaunic Salon</u></strong> . It involves sprucely selecting high quality </span><a href=\"https://www.stylecraze.com/articles/herbal-cosmetic-brands-available-in-india/\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 18px; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px; color: rgb(255, 90, 120); text-decoration-line: none; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;\" title=\"Top 10 Herbal Cosmetic Brands Available In India\">chemical free cosmetics</a><span style=\"color: rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"> for makeup and styling. The high quality makeup base keeps the makeup from cracking or smudging easily.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.7; color: rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;\"><em><strong>A few special incorporations of this bridal package are:</strong></em></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.7; color: rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;\">(i) 1 sitting of a special bridal facial.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.7; color: rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;\">(ii) 1 sitting of full body wax.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.7; color: rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;\">(iii) <span style=\"color: rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">1 hair spa session</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.7; color: rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;\">(iv) <span style=\"color: rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">Threading- eyebrows, upper lips, forehead, chin</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.7; color: rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;\">(v) <span style=\"color: rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">1 sitting of pedicure</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.7; color: rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;\">(vi) <span style=\"color: rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">1 sitting of manicure</span></p>\r\n', '1', '1', '2021-10-19 06:01:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, ''),
(61, 1, '1', 'Special Bridal Package By The Golden Palms- And Spa:', 'special-bridal-package-by-the-golden-palms-and-spa', NULL, 8, 19999.00, 0.00, '<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.7; color: rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;\">This is mainly a pre-bridal package that makes you ready for your engagement, Mehendi and Sangeet. It works on making your skin problem free and radiant.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.7; color: rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;\">A few special incorporations of this pre-bridal engagement ready package are- gold facial, full body wax, full body massage, papaya and rose body glow, crystal salt’s scrub session for body toning, hair spa, threading, manicure and pedicure.</p>\r\n', '1', '1', '2021-10-19 06:06:47', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, ''),
(62, 1, '1', 'Reception Bridal Package', 'reception-bridal-package', NULL, 8, 1499.00, 0.00, '<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.7; color: rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;\">Beaunic Salon that offers skin healthy cosmetics. The Reception bridal package by <span style=\"color: rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">Beaunic Salon</span> offers a sophisticated look to Indian Brides.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.7; color: rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;\">A few special incorporations of the Reception Bridal Package by <span style=\"color: rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">Beaunic Salon are:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.7; color: rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;\">(i) Draping sarees in different styles (traditional,      south Indian, Lehanga style, V shape and much more).</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.7; color: rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;\">(ii) Hair styling (with hair accessories like flowers,      beads, ornaments and much more).</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.7; color: rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;\">(iii) Makeup (face, hands and feet).</p>\r\n', '1', '1', '2021-10-19 06:24:20', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, ''),
(63, 1, '1', 'Premium Bridal Makeup', 'premium-bridal-makeup', NULL, 8, 8999.00, 0.00, '<p><span style=\"color: rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">This bridal package focuses on making Indian brides photo ready for their wedding day. It may include gold facial, waxing, body exfoliation, manicure, pedicure and threading.</span></p>\r\n', '1', '1', '2021-10-19 08:51:58', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, ''),
(64, 1, '1', 'Altra Glow Bridal Package', 'altra-glow-bridal-package', NULL, 8, 8000.00, 0.00, '<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.7; color: rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;\">This is a bridal package exclusive to dull skin. This 2 weeks bridal care treatment offers the goodness of Meso Glow and Aqua radiance to transform your skin from lifeless to lively.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.7; color: rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;\"> </p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.7; color: rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;\">The above-listed 10 bridal makeup prices are dream bridal treatments to transform your looks completely on your special day!.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.7; color: rgb(66, 66, 66); font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;\">Would you like to experience the dramatic effects of these bridal packages for your big day? Which bridal package did you choose for your wedding? Do share your feedback in the comment section.</p>\r\n', '1', '1', '2023-11-05 12:10:09', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, ''),
(65, 22, '22', 'Threading', 'threading', NULL, 9, 59.00, 0.00, '<p>Time: 30 Min</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Note:- Eyebrow, Forehead, Upper lip, Chin,  </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>A preferable alternative to waxing, it helps you to get beautiful and hairless skin in no time. You can choose between your Eyebrow, Forehead, Upper lip, and Chin, or all of them together, enabling you to get a smooth and glowing face.</p>\r\n', '0', '1', '2023-03-06 11:00:55', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, ''),
(66, 23, '23', 'testing', 'testing', NULL, 22, 100.00, 0.00, '<p>testing</p>\r\n', '0', '2', '2023-03-27 14:51:37', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, '');
